 "name": "Donut Joe's Pelham: chalkboard, 32\" portrait (DP-13 E2d; one file since E2e)",
 "notes": "Paste into Layout (JSON) on the Design tab of a portrait layout whose Menu tab uses the counter board's menu (Use this menu), then Check: it offers Today's specials (room 6, dates and times) and the Chalk note (dates and times) as new lists on that menu; Make these lists, then Preview and Publish. The other blocks show the counter board's lists. With \"Show the coffee bar\" off (the customer's tick box in the menu editor's Board look), Today's specials takes the full width; with it on, it sits beside the coffee bar. Looks: House (the counter board's colours and fonts) or Chalkboard. Internal spec only: not for a public ad without the owner's permission.",
